{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If an object is visible, move to it, then take it. Check its properties and sort it.     list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SortObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />\"",
